    "title": "ZUULI anonymous wake service",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Independent of the Free2Z account API. No Authorization/Cookie headers, queries, arbitrary payloads or account relations. Anonymous one-use invitations and separate 256-bit capabilities. Private acceptance only."
